==============================================================================
LRC loneliness spectral gap: floor 1/n (AP) vs edge 2/(2n-1)
(doubled-apex witness)   oracle-2026-06-01-S552c
==============================================================================

(C1) A_n = {1,2,...,n-2, 2(n-1)} : the AP with the apex runner DOUBLED.
     claim: max-collar(A_n) = 2/(2n-1) exactly, witnessed at t*=2/(2n-1).
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    n                                A_n   max-collar         t*  =2/(2n-1)?
    4                          (1, 2, 6)          2/7        5/7        True
    5                       (1, 2, 3, 8)          2/9        7/9        True
    6                   (1, 2, 3, 4, 10)         2/11       2/11        True
    7                (1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 12)         2/13      11/13        True
    8             (1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 14)         2/15      13/15        True
    9          (1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 16)         2/17       2/17        True
   10                 (1, 2, 3, ..., 18)         2/19       2/19        True
   11                 (1, 2, 3, ..., 20)         2/21       2/21        True
   12                 (1, 2, 3, ..., 22)         2/23       2/23        True
   13                 (1, 2, 3, ..., 24)         2/25       2/25        True
   14                 (1, 2, 3, ..., 26)         2/27      25/27        True
   15                 (1, 2, 3, ..., 28)         2/29      27/29        True
   16                 (1, 2, 3, ..., 30)         2/31      29/31        True
   17                 (1, 2, 3, ..., 32)         2/33      31/33        True
   18                 (1, 2, 3, ..., 34)         2/35      33/35        True
   19                 (1, 2, 3, ..., 36)         2/37      35/37        True
   20                 (1, 2, 3, ..., 38)         2/39      37/39        True
   21                 (1, 2, 3, ..., 40)         2/41       2/41        True
   22                 (1, 2, 3, ..., 42)         2/43       2/43        True
  => A_n hits the gap edge 2/(2n-1) for ALL n in 4..22: True
  closed form: at t*=2/(2n-1):
     runner 1        -> ||2/(2n-1)||      = 2/(2n-1)
     runner 2(n-1)   -> ||(4n-4)/(2n-1)|| = ||2 - 2/(2n-1)|| = 2/(2n-1)
     runner s (2<=s<=n-2) -> ||2s/(2n-1)|| = min(2s,2n-1-2s)/(2n-1) >= 3/(2n-1)
  so min-collar at t* = 2/(2n-1); the max over t equals this (verified).

